.TH PUTS 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
puts \- write a string and newline to standard output
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <stdio.h>
.PP
.BI "int puts(const char* " text ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes the NUL-terminated string followed by a newline to the Crunch standard
output stream.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a nonnegative value on success, or
.B EOF
on error with
.B errno
and the stream error indicator set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fputs (3crunch),
.BR putchar (3crunch),
.BR stdout (3crunch)
